* ARM/FIRE button debounce at 3.3 V (Rev DD, Teensy 4.1) -- ACTIVE LOW
* Rpu = 6.9k, C = 2.2 uF, contact Ron = 10 ohm, SEVERE bounce (5 ms opens)
.tran 0 120m 0 2u
V33  v33 0 3.3
Rpu  v33 btn 6.9k
C1   btn 0 2.2u
S1   btn 0 vctl 0 SWBTN
Vctl vctl 0 PWL(
+ 0.000m 0
+ 0.999m 0
+ 1.000m 1
+ 1.499m 1
+ 1.500m 0
+ 6.499m 0
+ 6.500m 1
+ 6.999m 1
+ 7.000m 0
+ 11.999m 0
+ 12.000m 1
+ 12.499m 1
+ 12.500m 0
+ 17.499m 0
+ 17.500m 1
+ 17.999m 1
+ 18.000m 0
+ 22.999m 0
+ 23.000m 1
+ 49.999m 1
+ 50.000m 0
+ 54.999m 0
+ 55.000m 1
+ 55.999m 1
+ 56.000m 0
+ 60.999m 0
+ 61.000m 1
+ 61.999m 1
+ 62.000m 0
+ 66.999m 0
+ 67.000m 1
+ 67.999m 1
+ 68.000m 0
+ 100m 0
+ )
.model SWBTN SW(Ron=10 Roff=1G Vt=0.5 Vh=0.1)
.end
